class GeoLine3(System.ValueType):
    """Whether a segment touches another shape.

    Represents a 3D line segment defined by a start point and an end point.

    How far a segment is from another shape, and how deep inside one it sits.

    Where a segment crosses another shape.

    The point of a segment nearest another shape, the shortest segment joining the two, and which edge of it
    faces one.

    A segment asked about a ball: how far apart they are, whether they touch, where they cross, and where the
    shortest segment between them runs.

    A line segment asked how far it is from a spline, whether they touch, where they cross and where the shortest
    segment between them runs.

    A line segment asked about an infinite line: whether they touch, how far apart they are, where they cross and
    where the shortest segment between them runs."""
