class GeoPolyline2(System.Object):
    """Whether a polyline touches another shape.

    Represents a 2D polyline: an open chain of connected line segments.

    A polyline is always a path, never a region. Geometry that closes back on itself is a GeoPolygon2, which is
    where area, containment and winding live; GeoPolyline2.ToPolygon converts a chain whose shape is meant to
    enclose something.

    How far a polyline is from another shape, and how deep inside one it sits.

    Where a polyline crosses another shape.

    The point of a polyline nearest another shape, the shortest segment joining the two, and which edge of it
    faces one.

    A polyline asked how far it is from a spline, whether they touch, where they cross and where the shortest
    segment between them runs."""
