class GeoRay3(System.ValueType):
    """Whether a ray touches another shape.

    Represents a 3D ray: a half-line starting at an origin and running to infinity in one direction.

    How far a ray is from another shape, and how deep inside one it sits.

    Where a ray crosses another shape.

    The point of a ray nearest another shape, the shortest segment joining the two, and which edge of it faces
    one.

    A ray asked about a ball: how far apart they are, whether they touch, where they cross, and where the
    shortest segment between them runs.

    A ray asked how far it is from a spline, whether they touch, where they cross and where the shortest segment
    between them runs.

    A ray asked about an infinite line: whether they touch, how far apart they are, where they cross and where
    the shortest segment between them runs."""
