    and GeoSphere3.SignedDistanceTo keeps the depth of that point, negative, for the ones that ask how deep.
    Where only the shell matters, GeoSphere3.DistanceToSurface measures to it from either side.

    How far a ball is from another shape, and how deep inside it a point sits.

    Where the surface of a ball is crossed by another shape.

    The point of a ball nearest another shape, and the shortest segment joining the two.

    A ball asked how far it is from a spline, whether they touch, where they cross and where the shortest segment
    between them runs."""
