class GeoXLine3(System.ValueType):
    """Whether an infinite line touches another shape in space.

    Represents an infinite line in space: a point on it and a direction it runs along both ways for ever, the
    counterpart of GeoRay3 with no start, of GeoXLine2 in the plane, and of the XLINE of AutoCAD.

    How far an infinite line is from another shape in space.

    Where an infinite line crosses another shape in space.

    The point of an infinite line nearest a point, and the shortest segment joining a line to another shape in
    space.

    An infinite line asked about a ball: how far apart they are, whether they touch, where they cross, and where
    the shortest segment between them runs.

    An infinite line asked how far it is from a spline, whether they touch, where they cross and where the
    shortest segment between them runs."""
